&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent | Hybrid | Infor | ERP&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Infor ERP Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design, governance and evolution of enterprise-wide ERP solutions within a complex operational environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be responsible for shaping solution architecture across manufacturing, supply chain, warehousing, finance and asset management functions, ensuring business requirements are translated into scalable, supportable and commercially viable solutions. Working closely with business stakeholders, technical teams and delivery functions, you will ensure architectural integrity is maintained throughout the solution lifecycle while supporting ongoing transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
