&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent | Hybrid | Data Architecture | ETL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Data Architect to design and govern enterprise-scale data architectures that support complex, data-driven programmes. This role will be responsible for shaping data strategy, defining information models, and delivering robust data platforms capable of supporting advanced analytics and artificial intelligence initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with engineering, analytics, data science, and business stakeholders to ensure data is trusted, accessible, and structured effectively across the organisation. This is an excellent opportunity for someone who enjoys solving complex data challenges and influencing the future direction of large-scale digital transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain conceptual, logical, and physical data models across multiple domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and govern scalable ETL/ELT data pipelines that support enterprise reporting, analytics, and AI workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish data standards, governance frameworks, and best practices to improve data quality and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical and business stakeholders to define data requirements and strategic roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the implementation of a single source of truth across complex and diverse datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the adoption of modern cloud-based data platforms and architecture patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data solutions are secure, scalable, maintainable, and aligned to organisational objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural leadership across data engineering, analytics, and AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Data Architecture, Data Modelling, and Enterprise Information Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and implementing ETL/ELT pipelines within large-scale environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in creating conceptual, logical, and physical data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining data governance standards, metadata management, and data quality frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern cloud data platforms and data integration technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage effectively with senior stakeholders and translate business requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within highly regulated, complex, or large-scale organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or enabling &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of MLOps, feature stores, real-time analytics, or automated data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data mesh, domain-driven design, or modern data architecture patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data cataloguing, lineage, and observability tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working on large-scale digital transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will establish scalable, well-governed data architectures that enable trusted decision-making, advanced analytics, and AI-driven innovation. They will provide strategic leadership across data initiatives, ensuring data is effectively modelled, integrated, and managed while supporting complex business and technology programmes. Success will be measured through the delivery of resilient data solutions, improved data quality and accessibility, and the creation of a strong foundation for future digital transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Peregrine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build workforces that deliver tech and change programmes at leading UK organisations. By combining data science from Peregrine Intelligence, our industry-accredited Peregrine Academy, and market-leading attraction and diversity initiatives, we bridge capability gaps at all levels in public and private sector organisations. We work closely with our clients to understand their challenges and deliver flexible, long-term solutions that make a real difference. When you join Peregrine, you become part of a team that’s focused on growth, both yours, our clients’, and the sectors we support. You’ll also get access to a full range of benefits alongside your salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Specialist Talent Works&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a permanent employee at Peregrine, you’ll be part of our Specialist Talent team. That means you’ll work on-site or remotely with our clients, supporting them on complex, high-impact projects in Data, Digital and Business Transformation. You’ll get the variety and challenge of consultancy work, with the stability and support of a permanent role. You’re not a contractor - you’re a valued member of our team, with access to all the same benefits, learning opportunities, and community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re curious, open, and always learning. We believe in doing great work and doing it with integrity. We support each other, share ideas freely, and celebrate progress big and small. And we care about the impact we make, whether that’s helping clients solve tough problems or creating opportunities for people from all walks of life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be a diverse team, with 20+ nationalities represented across Peregrine. We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences, and we’re committed to building an inclusive workplace where everyone can thrive. Through our partnerships and internal initiatives, we’re working to improve social mobility, reduce our environmental impact, and help our clients build more inclusive teams too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.global/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;peregrine.global&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; or check out our LinkedIn page: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.global/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;peregrine-resourcing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission at ŌURA is to empower every person to own their inner potential. Our award-winning products help our global community gain a deeper knowledge of their readiness, activity, and sleep quality by using their Oura Ring and its connected app. We&#39;ve helped millions of people understand and improve their health by providing daily insights and practical steps to inspire healthy lifestyles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empowering the world starts with living &lt;a href=&quot;https://ouraring.com/about-us&quot;&gt;our values&lt;/a&gt; and empowering our team. As a quickly growing company focused on helping people live healthier and happier lives, we ensure that our team members have what they need to do their best work — both in and out of the office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oura is rebuilding how it builds software. Every engineer has agentic tooling, and our own pipeline already takes a well-formed ticket to a reviewed, tested commit stack. It runs interactively, headless, and on a cloud sandbox fleet, with its own evals and tracing. We are looking for engineers who use AI as a fundamental building block of both the products we ship and the way we build them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That is a strong start on one stage of the lifecycle. The next step is the whole loop. As a Staff Engineer on the AI Transformation team, you will architect and own the system that turns agentic development from something power users do into the way hundreds of engineers across iOS, Android, backend and AI services ship every day. That means spec and intake, planning, implementation, review, testing, CI/CD, release, observability and incident follow-up, each with agents doing real work and humans keeping judgment where it matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fast-moving, LLM-forward team. We prioritize rapid prototyping, iterative loops and AI-native development, with the speed of a startup and the reach of a product used by millions of members. You can work hybrid from our UK office in London. You will need the existing right to work in the UK; we are not able to sponsor a visa for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the pipeline, measure it, and make it trustworthy enough that teams choose it. Success is measured in validated changes reaching members faster and safer: time to a trustworthy signal, escaped defects, cost per merged change, and how many squads run on the paved path because it is better, not because they were told to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to do all of these on day one, but these are the kinds of problems you&#39;ll own:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the technical direction for the agentic pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Make our existing ticket-to-PR pipeline dependable infrastructure. Own its architecture, including agent orchestration, context management and tool calling, and improve its reliability, throughput, cost and developer experience across mobile, backend and web repositories. Run it unattended where the risk allows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the loop across the SDLC:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend agentic workflows beyond code generation into spec quality checks, test generation, automated review, CI failure triage and repair, release verification, and post-deploy signals, so the system improves from what happens after merge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype fast, then harden:&lt;/strong&gt; Get a new workflow running in days, prove it on real tickets with real squads, and turn what holds up into production infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run AI in production properly:&lt;/strong&gt; Agents in production take more than an API call. Own the eval sets, LLM-as-a-judge grading, versioning, tracing and dashboards that tell us whether a workflow change made things better, including the hardest case: a change that passes CI and is still wrong. Track the numbers that matter (merge rate, rework, time-to-signal, cost per change, escaped defects) and make them visible to engineers and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make autonomy safe:&lt;/strong&gt; Design sandboxing, permissions, human checkpoints and guardrails proportional to risk, with privacy by design as the default. Health data, security and infrastructure changes get stronger controls; low-risk, easily verified work runs hands-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI-native engineering by example:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the bar for AI-augmented engineering across the organization. Show in your own work what a pipeline-first engineer ships, and raise the craft of the engineers around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive adoption with the teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed with squads and their AI DRIs, find where the pipeline breaks on real work, fix the system rather than the single output, and turn what works into paved paths, skills, templates and docs other engineers can extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with platform, developer productivity, security and privacy, AI infrastructure, mobile and backend squads, product and design, and engineering leadership to make trade-offs explicit and keep everyone moving on one system instead of five parallel ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An experienced builder:&lt;/strong&gt; Building and operating production systems that other engineers depend on, including developer tooling, internal platforms, or AI infrastructure at scale. We weigh demonstrated outcomes over years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven with agentic loops in production:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built and operated agentic coding workflows or autonomous loops in a real engineering organization, beyond demos: background agents producing PRs, automated review, CI repair, test generation, or similar, with adoption and measured results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A whole-lifecycle thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You reason about specification, review, testing, CI/CD, release and operations as one system, and you know where the bottleneck moves when code generation gets cheap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A technical leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You set direction across teams you don&#39;t manage, write the designs others build on, and are trusted with the hard calls on architecture and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong on fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; mobile domain or backend APIs, concurrency, distributed systems, testing, debugging and reliability. You treat AI output as a draft and can show how you verify it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically versatile:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in one domain of backend, iOS, or Android, with a stretch into others. You use the tools available to work across platforms and pick up new stacks quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and privacy conscious:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the responsibility of handling sensitive personal data and of giving agents access to real systems, and you design for both from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in ambiguity and shape the requirements yourself through experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and resilient:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring teams along, take feedback from engineers who are skeptical, share credit, and keep going when experiments fail or the tooling changes under you. You communicate clearly with engineers, managers and non-engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Would be a benefit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need all of these, but they&#39;re nice signals of fit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with coding agents at depth: skills, MCP servers, hooks, sub-agent orchestration, headless runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built evaluation harnesses or benchmarks for coding agents, or LLM-as-judge grading tied to build and test outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sandboxed execution at scale: ephemeral dev environments, VM or container fleets, macOS build infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in developer productivity measurement (DORA, SPACE, DX Core 4) and in turning metrics into decisions without turning them into targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped to mobile apps or other environments with slow, expensive feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in digital health, wearables, MedTech, or other privacy-sensitive or regulated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source AI projects, or a portfolio of projects built on the latest agent capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentored engineers or led an engineering community of practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Oura, we care about you and your well-being. Everyone here at Oura has a ring of their own and we are continually looking to improve employee health and add to our benefits!&lt;br&gt;What we offer:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An Oura Ring of your own + employee discounts for friends &amp;amp; family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing culture of collaborative and passionate coworkers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If this sounds like the next step for you, please send us your application and CV as soon as possible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2Kv6p&quot; data-ui=&quot;careers-page-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ŌURA is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Individuals seeking employment at ŌURA are considered without regard to age, ancestry, color, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, medical condition, mental or physical disability, national origin, protected family care or medical leave status, race, religion (including beliefs and practices or the absence thereof), sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. We will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disclaimer: Beware of fake job offers!&lt;br&gt;We’ve been alerted to scammers posing as ŌURA recruiters, especially for remote roles. Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our jobs are listed only on the ŌURA Careers page and trusted job boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask for personal information like ID or payment for equipment upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Official offers are sent through Docusign after a verbal offer, not via text or email.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay cautious and protect your personal details.&lt;/p&gt;
